{c_label}Spawn Rate: {/c_label} Every {c_number}[{SF_2}||]{/c} seconds
{c_label}Lucky Hit Chance: {/c}{c_resource}[{Combat Effect Chance}|%|]{/c}
{c_label}Passive:{/c} Manifest up to {c_number}[{SF_0}||]{/c} {c_important}Anomalies{/c_important} that emit particles which deal {c_random}{payload:DOT_DAMAGE_BASELINE}{/c} damage over {c_number}[{SF_8}||]{/c} seconds.

{c_label}Active:{/c} Command your {c_important}Anomalies{/c_important} to all converge and implode, dealing {c_random}{payload:IMPLOSION_BASELINE}{/c} damage per detonation.{if:SF_31}

While at {c_number}[{SF_0}||]{/c} {c_important}Anomalies{/c_important}, you are {c_important}{u}Unstoppable{/u}{/c} and the next series of implosions will deal double damage.{/if}
